Distance: 1500 M Conditions: Variable tail/cross wind throughout racing; 7&#45;9 mph; flat water. Comments: B2 declared a dead heat. G2 started a full length over the start line. G1 started 5 meters behind the starting line. Choate G5 caught a boat&#45;stopping crab in the last ten strokes. Nice job by all cox&#39;ns on a tricky aligning day. Thanks to Taft and Choate for some great early&#45;season racing.
